      {
        "id": 222673,
        "name": "robb8888",
        "username": "robb8888",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-02T23:09:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Below, I think, is the \"list\" of cards with (1) \"OR\"s and (2) an empty space before the \"ORs.\"&nbsp; Also, this is a suggestion I saw somebody else make on another board/thread, but for the next printing, might it be clearer to swap out the empty line for \"Then, either....\", similar to Serpent Slumbering's \"Gift\" cards?&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>For example, with a \"then, either,\" Sacrosanct Wilderness would read:&nbsp; \"<em>Push 2 Dahan.&nbsp; <strong>Then, either</strong> 2 Damage per Wilds in target land OR Add 1 Wilds.</em>\"</p>\n<p>List:</p>\n<p>Crops Wither and Fade</p>\n<p>Gift of Flowing Power (includes <em>an \"either\"</em>)</p>\n<p>Gift of the Primordial Deeps (<em>includes an \"either\"</em>)</p>\n<p>Growth Through Sacrifice</p>\n<p>Sacrosanct Wilderness</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:39.971Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
